</div></div><span data-testid="core-ui-spacer" class="sc-38fb062f-6 hGEXpF"></span><div class="sc-26b69c27-1 bnjfeU"><div class="sc-26b69c27-0 jmaKIK"><span data-testid="core-ui-button-wrapper" class="sc-38fb062f-41 jmWVPO"><div role="region" aria-live="polite"><span class="sc-38fb062f-7 jlwDqq"></span></div><a data-testid="core-ui-button" data-tracking-category="Hero Link Button" data-tracking-action="click" data-tracking-label="Homepage &gt; Brand Redesign Jun 2025 &gt; Hero" data-tracking-value="Sign up to ride" type="button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" aria-label="Sign up to ride" href="https://lyft.sng.link/Adnq0/o6zi4?_dl=lyft%3A%2F%2F%3Fssid%3Df4f19524-e7be-4b7c-82b7-f491ea83b09bL1790498259%26referral%3D%252F&amp;_smtype=3&amp;_ddl=lyft%3A%2F%2F%3Fssid%3Df4f19524-e7be-4b7c-82b7-f491ea83b09bL1790498259%26referral%3D%252F" style="--padding:24px;--min-height:48px;--min-width:120px" class="sc-38fb062f-42 sc-38fb062f-43 eNhDUQ iTMwji"><span class="sc-38fb062f-60 htOXry"><span data-testid="multi-line-text-wrap" class="sc-38fb062f-0 cyrOuK"><span data-testid="icon-button-text" class="sc-38fb062f-33 gaGpvx">Sign up to ride</span></span></span></a></span></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-bc46f060-2 kqyLmr"></div><div class="sc-bc46f060-3 jqAENv"><picture data-testid="img-container"><source data-testid="webp-source" type="image/webp" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/q8mvene1wzq4/35FO36I7e1AvaQUBNsD7ga/abd0e6520f9c41214bc630ac508cd61c/Hero_image_DT.png?w=2500&amp;q=60&amp;fm=webp"/><source data-testid="source" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/q8mvene1wzq4/35FO36I7e1AvaQUBNsD7ga/abd0e6520f9c41214bc630ac508cd61c/Hero_image_DT.png?w=2500&amp;q=60&amp;fm="/><img src="//images.ctfassets.net/q8mvene1wzq4/35FO36I7e1AvaQUBNsD7ga/abd0e6520f9c41214bc630ac508cd61c/Hero_image_DT.png?w=2500&amp;q=60&amp;fm=" alt="Smiling older woman with a yellow scarf leans into a car, holding a tote bag, while a man looks back at her." class="sc-e45a5542-0 fIzxcm sc-80567da7-1 bbgWJE"/></picture></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="sc-a6eb88a4-1 kDNvAh"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sc-e5128df8-0 dhfbOV sc-94684220-0 eBDxTz" data-tracking-label="Homepage &gt; Brand Redesign Jun 2025 &gt; Driver Module" data-tracking-action="view" data-tracking-category="TextImageModule"><div class="sc-38fb062f-152 gwhofV"><div data-testid="core-ui-layout-grid" class="sc-38fb062f-151 dLUGdN"><div class="sc-e5128df8-0 iOGSrd"><div class="sc-a6eb88a4-0 fVUrCc"><div aria-hidden="true" class="sc-a6eb88a4-1 kDNvAh"></div><div class="sc-a6eb88a4-2 cpUhry"><div data-testid="core-ui-layout-grid" class="sc-38fb062f-151 wgtNV"><div data-testid="core-ui-layout-container" class="sc-38fb062f-150 iquFqC"></div><div data-testid="core-ui-layout-container" class="sc-38fb062f-150 gmnuGu"><div class="sc-d1b298cf-2 iACTZI"><picture data-testid="img-container"><source data-testid="webp-source" type="image/webp" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/q8mvene1wzq4/1tiy0lVEdDpuib18k2cWGX/a72e1927716f69922384d4f675b44a0e/Module_Hero_1_DT.png?w=1500&amp;q=60&amp;fm=webp"/><source data-testid="source" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/q8mvene1wzq4/1tiy0lVEdDpuib18k2cWGX/a72e1927716f69922384d4f675b44a0e/Module_Hero_1_DT.png?w=1500&amp;q=60&amp;fm="/><img src="//images.ctfassets.net/q8mvene1wzq4/1tiy0lVEdDpuib18k2cWGX/a72e1927716f69922384d4f675b44a0e/Module_Hero_1_DT.png?w=1500&amp;q=60&amp;fm=" alt="Smiling man in a coral shirt drives a car, touching a phone mounted on the dashboard, with a Lyft sticker visible." width="1008" height="672" loading="lazy" class="sc-e45a5542-0 fIzxcm sc-5242ca57-0 dtsefY"/></picture></div></div><div data-testid="core-ui-layout-container" class="sc-38fb062f-150 caPwzA"></div><div data-testid="core-ui-layout-container" class="sc-38fb062f-150 dJovZP"><div class="sc-d1b298cf-0 hsHfjo"><div class="sc-d1b298cf-1 kGNSaH"><h2 data-testid="core-ui-text" class="sc-38fb062f-33 ctNJhY sc-a418a671-0 sc-49e044f4-0 cztyXO" customTextStyle="headline