stid="core-ui-spacer" class="sc-38fb062f-6 hFoBaS"></span><div interactiveColor="brandInteractive" class="sc-cca8783b-2 gAVnUe"><div class="sc-cca8783b-1 bYKooJ"><p data-testid="core-ui-text" customTextStyle="bodyW2" class="sc-38fb062f-33 hcxqiL sc-a418a671-0">Provide reliable rides for the people who matter to your business. Whether it’s team members heading into work or traveling to client meetings, conferences or training sessions.</p></div>
</div><span data-testid="core-ui-spacer" class="sc-38fb062f-6 hGEXpF"></span><div class="sc-d1b298cf-6 XHaFB"><span data-testid="core-ui-button-wrapper" class="sc-38fb062f-41 jmWVPO"><div role="region" aria-live="polite"><span class="sc-38fb062f-7 jlwDqq"></span></div><a data-testid="core-ui-button" data-tracking-action="click" data-tracking-category="TextImageModule primary button" data-tracking-label="Homepage &gt; Brand Redesign Jun 2025 &gt; Lyft Business" data-tracking-value="Get started today" class="sc-38fb062f-42 sc-38fb062f-43 eNhDUQ iTMwji sc-93b312e0-0 cSLksX" type="button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" aria-label="Get started today" href="/business" style="--padding:24px;--min-height:48px;--min-width:120px"><span class="sc-38fb062f-60 htOXry"><span data-testid="multi-line-text-wrap" class="sc-38fb062f-0 cyrOuK"><span data-testid="icon-button-text" class="sc-38fb062f-33 gaGpvx">Get started today</span></span></span></a></span><span data-testid="core-ui-button-wrapper" class="sc-38fb062f-41 jmWVPO"><div role="region" aria-live="polite"><span class="sc-38fb062f-7 jlwDqq"></span></div><a data-testid="core-ui-text-button" data-tracking-action="click" data-tracking-category="TextImageModule secondary button" data-tracking-label="Homepage &gt; Brand Redesign Jun 2025 &gt; Lyft Business" data-tracking-value="Explore solutions" type="button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" aria-label="Explore solutions" href="/business/solutions" style="--padding:24px;--min-height:48px;--min-width:120px" class="sc-38fb062f-42 sc-38fb062f-50 daHBHk cQutfr"><span class="sc-38fb062f-60 htOXry"><span data-testid="multi-line-text-wrap" class="sc-38fb062f-0 cyrOuK"><span data-testid="icon-button-text" class="sc-38fb062f-33 eSNXOU">Explore solutions</span></span><span data-testid="core-ui-spacer" class="sc-38fb062f-6 cJBvWV"></span><span data-testid="icon-xS" class="sc-38fb062f-15 gfvPeb"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="fill:currentColor" aria-hi