/picture></div><span data-testid="core-ui-spacer" class="sc-38fb062f-6 iqxkdU"></span></div><div data-testid="core-ui-layout-container" class="sc-38fb062f-150 caPwzA"></div><div data-testid="core-ui-layout-container" class="sc-38fb062f-150 fDeuBx"><div class="sc-d1b298cf-0 hsHfjo"><div class="sc-d1b298cf-1 kGNSaH"><h2 data-testid="core-ui-text" class="sc-38fb062f-33 ctNJhY sc-a418a671-0 sc-49e044f4-0 cztyXO" customTextStyle="headlineW1">Safety never takes a backseat</h2><span data-testid="core-ui-spacer" class="sc-38fb062f-6 hFoBaS"></span><div interactiveColor="brandInteractive" class="sc-cca8783b-2 gAVnUe"><div class="sc-cca8783b-1 bYKooJ"><p data-testid="core-ui-text" customTextStyle="bodyW2" class="sc-38fb062f-33 hcxqiL sc-a418a671-0">We want to level up every single ride—and it starts with safety. With always-on protection from before you ride and customizable tools for added peace of mind, we’re a community built on putting safety first.</p></div>
</div><span data-testid="core-ui-spacer" class="sc-38fb062f-6 hGEXpF"></span><div class="sc-d1b298cf-6 XHaFB"><span data-testid="core-ui-button-wrapper" class="sc-38fb062f-41 jmWVPO"><div role="region" aria-live="polite"><span class="sc-38fb062f-7 jlwDqq"></span></div><a data-testid="core-ui-button" data-tracking-action="click" data-tracking-category="TextImageModule primary button" data-tracking-label="Homepage &gt; Brand Redesign Jun 2025 &gt; Safety" data-tracking-value="Learn more" class="sc-38fb062f-42 sc-38fb062f-43 eNhDUQ iTMwji sc-93b312e0-0 cSLksX" type="button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" aria-label="Learn more" href="/safety" style="--padding:24px;--min-height:48px;--min-width:120px"><span class="sc-38fb062f-60 htOXry"><span data-testid="multi-line-text-wrap" class="sc-38fb062f-0 cyrOuK"><span data-testid="icon-button-text" class="sc-38fb062f-33 gaGpvx">Learn more</span></span></span></a></span><span data-testid="core-ui-button-wrapper" class="sc-38fb062f-41 jmWVPO"><div role="region" aria-live="polite"><span class="sc-38fb062f-7 jlwDqq"></span></div><a data-testid="core-ui-text-button" data-tracking-action="click" data-tracking-category="TextImageModule secondary button" data-tracking-label="Homepage &gt; Brand Redesign Jun 2025 &gt; Safety" data-tracking-value="Community guidelines" type="button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" aria-label="Community guidelines" href="https://www.lyft.com/safety/community-guidelines" style="--padding:24px;--min-height:48px;--min-width:120px" class="sc-38fb062f-42 sc-38fb062f-50 daHBHk cQutfr"><span class="sc-38fb062f-60 htOXry"><span data-testid="multi-line-text-wrap" class="sc-38fb062f-0 cyrOuK"><span data-testid="icon-button-text" class="sc-38fb062f-33 eSNXOU">Community guidelines</span></span><span data-testid="core-ui-spacer" class="sc-38fb062f-6 cJBvWV"></span><span data-testid="icon-xS" class="sc-38fb062f-15 gfvPeb"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="fill:currentColor" aria-h